# =============================================================================
# UTILITIES — gitignore
# Principio: niente runtime data, niente segreti, niente artefatti locali.
# =============================================================================

# --- Run-time data per tool (output, log, audit, backup) -----------------------
# Pattern **/ copre qualsiasi profondita': root, primo livello tool, sotto-tool.
**/data/logs/
**/data/reports/
**/data/backups/
**/data/audit/
**/data/cache/
**/data/output/
**/data/exports/
**/data/temp/

# --- Export di 05-ProfileMigrator ---------------------------------------------
# La destinazione la sceglie il tecnico (di norma Desktop o USB), ma se per
# sbaglio finisse dentro il repo questi file conterrebbero password WiFi in
# chiaro, .reg di Outlook e mappature di rete. Rete di sicurezza.
Migration-*/
**/WiFi/*.xml
wlan-export-*/
manifest.json

# --- Temp con dati sensibili ---------------------------------------------------
wlan-summary-*/

# --- Safety net (anche fuori da data/) ----------------------------------------
*.log
*.jsonl
PowerShell_transcript.*.txt

# --- Binari portable di terze parti (scaricati al setup) ----------------------
**/tools/

# --- Segreti e credenziali (NON committare MAI) -------------------------------
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
*.secret
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.crt
*.cer
credentials.*

# --- Windows ------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.old
*.lnk

# --- macOS / Linux (se mai aprissi il repo cross-platform) --------------------
.DS_Store
._*

# --- Editor / IDE -------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.swp
*~

# --- PowerShell ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.pssproj.user

# --- Compilati (PS2EXE / similar) ---------------------------------------------
**/bin/
*.exe.config

# --- OneDrive / sync conflicts ------------------------------------------------
*-Conflict-*
*-Conflitto-*

# --- Claude Code workspace ----------------------------------------------------
.claude/
